## WF-1: Đăng nhập

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Auth API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>(username, password, source_ip)
    A->>DB: SELECT user WHERE username
    DB-->>A: user record (hash, status)

    alt user not found OR wrong password
        A-->>U: 401 {"error": "Invalid credentials"}
    else user locked/suspended
        A-->>U: 403 {"error": "Account unavailable"}
    else credentials valid + MFA disabled
        A->>DB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=success)
        A->>DB: INSERT session (token_hash, expires_at)
        A-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    else credentials valid + MFA enabled
        A->>DB: INSERT pre_auth_transaction (status=pending, expires_at+5min)
        A-->>U: 200 {mfa_required: true, session_id}
    end

    Note over U,A: MFA flow (nếu mfa_required=true)

    U->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/verify<br/>(session_id, mfa_code)
    A->>DB: SELECT pre_auth_transaction WHERE id=session_id
    DB-->>A: transaction record

    alt code wrong OR expired OR IP mismatch
        A->>DB: UPDATE pre_auth_transaction (status=failed)
        A-->>U: 401 {"error": "MFA failed"}
    else code valid
        A->>DB: UPDATE pre_auth_transaction (status=completed)
        A->>DB: INSERT login_attempt (outcome=mfa_success)
        A->>DB: INSERT session (token_hash, expires_at)
        A-->>U: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    end
```

