## WF-3: SOC xem và xử lý Alert

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SOC Analyst
    participant A as Auth API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    S->>A: GET /api/v1/alerts<br/>(status=open, risk_level=high)
    A->>DB: SELECT alerts WHERE status=? AND risk_level=?
    DB-->>A: [alert1, alert2, ...]
    A-->>S: 200 {alerts: [...]}

    S->>A: GET /api/v1/alerts/{id}
    A->>DB: SELECT alert WHERE id=?
    DB-->>A: alert detail + login_attempt info
    A-->>S: 200 {alert: {...}}

    alt Acknowledge alert
        S->>A: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}<br/>{status: "acknowledged", notes: "..."}
        A->>DB: UPDATE alert (status=acknowledged, assigned_to=S.id)
        A-->>S: 200 {alert: {status: "acknowledged"}}
    else Resolve alert (false positive)
        S->>A: PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}<br/>{status: "resolved", notes: "user traveling", resolved_by: S.id}
        A->>DB: UPDATE alert (status=resolved, resolved_by, resolved_at)
        A-->>S: 200 {alert: {status: "resolved"}}
    end
```

