## WF-4: MFA Flow - Chi tiết

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Auth API
    participant N as MFA Notification
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,A: MFA được trigger khi:<br/>1. Login với MFA enabled<br/>2. Risk level HIGH/CRITICAL<br/>3. Sensitive operation

    == MFA Types ==

    alt MFA via EMAIL OTP
        A->>N: Send OTP via Email
        N-->>A: notification_id
        A->>DB: INSERT mfa_notification (channel=email)
        A-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: "email_otp", expires_in: 300}
        U->>A: POST /mfa/verify (code: "123456")

    else MFA via SMS OTP
        A->>N: Send OTP via SMS
        N-->>A: notification_id
        A->>DB: INSERT mfa_notification (channel=sms)
        A-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: "sms_otp", expires_in: 300}
        U->>A: POST /mfa/verify (code: "123456")

    else MFA via TOTP (Authenticator)
        A-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: "totp", setup_url: "otpauth://..."}
        Note over U: User nhập code từ<br/>Google Authenticator
        U->>A: POST /mfa/verify (code: "123456")

    else MFA via PUSH Notification
        A->>N: Send Push Notification
        N-->>A: notification_id
        A-->>U: 200 {mfa_type: "push", expires_in: 120}
        Note over U: User approve trên mobile app
        U->>A: POST /mfa/verify (action: "approve")
    end

    == Verification ==

    A->>DB: SELECT mfa_transaction WHERE id=session_id
    DB-->>A: transaction record

    alt Invalid / Expired / IP Mismatch
        A->>DB: UPDATE mfa_transaction (status=failed, fail_count+1)
        alt fail_count >= 3
            A->>DB: UPDATE user (status=locked)
            A-->>U: 403 ACCOUNT_LOCKED
        else fail_count < 3
            A-->>U: 401 MFA_FAILED (attempts_remaining: 2)
        end
    else Valid / Approved
        A->>DB: UPDATE mfa_transaction (status=completed)
        A->>DB: INSERT session
        A-->>U: 200 OK {access_token, mfa_verified: true}
    end

    == Trusted Device (Persistent MFA) ==

    alt User selects "Trust this device"
        U->>A: POST /mfa/trust-device (device_fingerprint)
        A->>DB: INSERT user_trusted_devices
        A-->>U: 200 {trusted: true, expires_at: "+30 days"}
    end

    Note over U: Lần đăng nhập sau với<br/>trusted device → Không cần OTP
```

